Before starting any task, read CONTEXT.md and PLAN.md in the project root.
Do only the task the user names. Do not start the next task.
Work in small steps, run the tests after each change, and never read or modify .env.
Follow the security rules in CONTEXT.md. If a package may not exist, say so instead of guessing.
When a task is done, update its checkbox in PLAN.md and summarize what changed.
